OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Freducing in number during the evening
OL,7,Fbut some continuing overnight, chiefly
OL,8,Faround northern and western coasts
OL,9,Fwhere they could still be heavy and
OL,10,Fthundery, and merge to longer spells
OL,11,Fof rain. A cool night with clear
OL,12,Fspells elsewhere.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FAnother showery day, with a
OL,15,Ffew of these again possibly thundery
OL,16,Fwith hail, especially in the south
OL,17,Fduring the afternoon. Sunnier spells
OL,18,Felsewhere. Feeling fresher than of
OL,19,Flate.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
